This directory holds a cut-down version of UNP64 with only the bare minimum
needed to decompress a number of Commodore 64 adventure games. It is
distributed under the zlib License by kind permission of the original authors
Magnus Lind and iAN CooG.

UNP64 - generic Commodore 64 prg unpacker
(C) 2008-2022 iAN CooG/HVSC Crew^C64Intros
original source and idea: testrun.c, taken from exo20b7

The 6502 emulator (6502_emu.cpp, 6502_emu.h) and the PRG loader and BASIC SYS
line parser (exo_util.cpp, exo_util.h) are code from Exomizer by Magnus Lind,
with modifications for UNP64 by iAN CooG and Petter Sjölund.

The C++ version is based on code adapted to ScummVM by Avijeet Maurya.
This is an altered version of that source and of the original software.

